;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "環境音\quiet-residential-area1.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "800" "3000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\ザッハ夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "600" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"Well then, I'll go home and look into the past incident. 
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE>, what I'd like you to do is think about whether anything comes to mind about the cause of <STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE>'s April sickness and her danger sense. [TN: A pun on gogatsu-byo, 'May sickness,' Japan's term for the May blues.] 
{PAUSE ""}
If you find out anything, please get in touch."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Okay."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> agreed with a </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">"guess it can't be helped"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> sort of smile.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Well then, be careful."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\自転車開始.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "SE\自転車こぐ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHGVOL "VOICE" "0" "3000" "WAIT"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> rode her bike back home.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\自転車開始.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
"Now then, Operation start."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> seen off, I got on my bike too and set my feet on the pedals.</STYLE><PG>
"Huh?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">I noticed something was wrong right away.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">My bike's tire had gone flat.</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "日没廃校.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="3">Pushing the bike all the way home is going to be quite a chore... but there's no other way...</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s words,</STYLE><BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Be careful,"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">stuck in my mind, strangely.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\桜道夜.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">The daytime clouds had cleared away completely, and everything around was lit by moonlight.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">The cherry blossoms in that light were very beautiful.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Pushing my bike along, I thought over this incident once more.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">The truth is, I had noticed something that even </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> probably hadn't noticed herself: the rule behind </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s intuition.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s intuition only starts to function when the person who is going to be harmed</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"I'm going there," "I'm doing that,"</STYLE><BR>
<STYLE ID="3">says it to </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> directly,</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">or when </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> sees them in action.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">So even if she learns about the situation of the person who's going to be harmed </STYLE><STYLE ID="5" RUBY="でんぶん">secondhand</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, her intuition doesn't work.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">This time, even though her </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> was killed, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> didn't notice, probably because she heard about the business trip from someone else.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Maybe it was </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Kogori-senpai's mother</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, or someone around there.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">But... something is still missing.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s intuition: the conditions it needs to work.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">There must be something more.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">Let me get my head back on the incident.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Could this incident not have been prevented?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Surely that isn't so. In the first place, a culprit brings about an incident because they have a purpose.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">Even a thrill-killer has a purpose: wanting to be a thrill-killer.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">In this case, I'll assume it's not a thrill-killer but a copycat.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">Yes: that it's connected to the Megasawa City case, and also to the accident in Central Park 10 years ago.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">If I'd grasped that beforehand, maybe I could have stopped it somehow.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">What exactly was the Central Park accident like?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">I stopped walking and took out my smartphone.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\スマフォ黄入.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "650" "C" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">“</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Motoki-cho Central Park accident”</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">When I searched with those words... the results were nothing but today's incident.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Let me narrow down the time period and search.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">........................</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">There it is, this is it!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9" RUBY="しよう">Shiyo</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> 788―exactly 12 years ago today―April 8.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Hanami visitor dies in accident at Central Park.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Died after falling from a cherry tree.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">The one who died was... </STYLE>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">No way...</STYLE>
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<PG>
{PLAYSND "忍び寄る影.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="3">It can't be...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Then today, that person's―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">that person's actions, what did they mean!?</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\se_maoudamashii_se_heartbeat01.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="3">My heartbeat grew impossibly fast.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<STYLE ID="3">Why...! Is that person the killer...!?</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">I can't just stand here! I have to plan the next Operation, fast!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">When I took my eyes off my smartphone and looked up, the cherry tree in front of me came into view.</STYLE><PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "SE" "0" "PASS"}
"............!!?"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "明かされた真実.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\手直し・追加\桜道夜赤.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\赤い人立ち.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "600" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">Under the tree, a bright-red person with the skin </STYLE><STYLE ID="10" RUBY="は">stripped</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> off was lit by the moonlight...!</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\うめき声.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\夢の目.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "50" "NORMAL" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\夢桜.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "NORMAL" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\赤顔.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "50" "NORMAL" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\手直し・追加\桜道夜赤.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "50" "NORMAL" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\夢の目.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "50" "NORMAL" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\手直し・追加\桜道夜赤.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "50" "NORMAL" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\赤顔.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "50" "NORMAL" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\手直し・追加\桜道夜赤.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\赤い人立ち.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "600" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="11">No, no!</STYLE><BR>
<STYLE ID="11">This is a hallucination!</STYLE><PG>
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<STYLE ID="3">I rubbed my eyes and looked at the tree once more.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\quiet-residential-area1.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "500" "5000" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\桜道夜.gal" "WAIT" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">What met my eyes was a bright-red―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">just a bright-red mailbox.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">I looked around, but there was no sign of anyone at all.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">Apparently it really had been a hallucination.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">I'm so </STYLE><STYLE ID="12" RUBY="おび">scared</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> right now that I'd see a hallucination like that.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">That's right, I'm very </STYLE><STYLE ID="12" RUBY="おび">scared</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> right now.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Because today's incident isn't over yet.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">It has only just begun.</STYLE><PG>
"To <STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE>... to <STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE>...!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\スマフォ黄入.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "650" "C" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">―I tried to call her, but </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{QUAKE "アイテム1" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "500" "30"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">my hands shook, and the sweat on them got in the way, so I couldn't make the call the way I wanted.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
"Really! Work! At a time like this...!"
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">I jabbed at the screen and swiped my fingers across it with all my strength.</STYLE><PG>
"Oh!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n携帯落とす\r\nアイテム1\r\n4\r\n540\r\n200\r\nINC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "200" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n携帯落とす\r\nアイテム1\r\n4\r\n540\r\n0\r\nINC\r\nPASS">
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯落とす.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">My smartphone slipped out of my shaking hands and fell into the storm drain.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">What do I do! At this rate it's way worse than Operation failed! </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> is in danger!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Next to be killed will be </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, and also...!</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\自転車止める.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "SE\アスファルトダッシュ.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\道1夜ブラー.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">I let go of my flat-tired bike and ran for the police station as fast as I could.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">I didn't know how many minutes it would take to get there.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Gasping for breath, I ran as far as I could run.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "1000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\道1夜.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"Hah! Hah!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">I put my hands on my knees and stopped.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">There was no sign of anyone around, and no sound.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\haa1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="3">My own ragged breathing sounded strangely loud in my ears.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE>... <STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE>...!"<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">The dark road, with few streetlights, went on and on.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">The moon seemed to be hidden, and I couldn't see well ahead.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">Wait, what am I panicking for!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">There's no need for me to go to the police station myself! All I have to do is borrow a phone at a house nearby!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Just as I was about to start running again,</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\棒を振る.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{STOPSND "SE" "0" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\tackle1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{QUAKE "000" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "500" "30"}
{PLAYSND "SE\down1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\道1夜倒れる.gal" "NORMAL" "14" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
